{"seq":4,"slug":"biomedical-engineering","title":"生物医学工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering","introMarkdown":"# 生物医学工程 简介\n\n生物医学工程是一门将工程学原理与方法系统应用于医学和生物学问题的交叉学科。本课程面向大学生物医学工程专业学生，旨在培养兼具工程技术能力与医学问题意识的复合型人才。\n\n本课程包含四个核心章节：\n\n第一章**工程基础**涵盖生物医学信号处理、生物力学基本原理以及生物医学电子技术，构建从信号采集到力学建模再到电路设计的完整工程能力。\n\n第二章**医学影像系统**从成像物理原理出发，深入医学图像处理技术，并延伸至当前最前沿的 AI 辅助诊断方法，帮助学生理解从信号到图像再到临床决策的全链路。\n\n第三章**生物材料与器件**系统讲授生物材料科学基础、医疗器械设计规范以及植入式器件技术，使学生掌握从材料选择到产品上市的核心工程知识。\n\n第四章**神经工程前沿**聚焦神经信号接口、脑机接口和康复工程三大前沿方向，展现生物医学工程在神经科学与临床康复中的最新突破。\n\n推荐学习路径：建议按照章节顺序学习。工程基础为后续章节提供方法论支撑，医学影像与生物材料两章可并行推进，神经工程前沿作为综合应用章节建议最后学习。学习过程中应注重理论与实验相结合，积极参与实验室项目和临床见习，将课本知识与实际医工问题紧密联系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-foundations","title":"工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/engineering-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biomedical-signals-processing","title":"生物医学信号处理","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/engineering-foundations/biomedical-signals-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biomechanics-fundamentals","title":"生物力学基本原理","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/engineering-foundations/biomechanics-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biomedical-electronics","title":"生物医学电子技术","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/engineering-foundations/biomedical-electronics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-imaging-systems","title":"医学影像系统","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/medical-imaging-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"imaging-physics-principles","title":"成像物理原理","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/medical-imaging-systems/imaging-physics-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-image-processing","title":"医学图像处理","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/medical-imaging-systems/medical-image-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-assisted-diagnosis","title":"AI 辅助诊断","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/medical-imaging-systems/ai-assisted-diagnosis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"biomaterials-devices","title":"生物材料与器件","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/biomaterials-devices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biomaterials-science","title":"生物材料科学","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/biomaterials-devices/biomaterials-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-instrument-design","title":"医疗器械设计","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/biomaterials-devices/medical-instrument-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"implantable-devices","title":"植入式器件","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/biomaterials-devices/implantable-devices"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"neural-engineering-frontiers","title":"神经工程前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neural-signal-interfaces","title":"神经信号接口","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers/neural-signal-interfaces"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brain-computer-interfaces","title":"脑机接口","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers/brain-computer-interfaces"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rehabilitation-engineering","title":"康复工程","url":"/education/university/medicine/biomedical-engineering/neural-engineering-frontiers/rehabilitation-engineering"}]}]}